      "text": "Today you will experience a full-day shared tour to the Actun Tunichil Muknal (ATM) Cave. After a jungle hike and a short swim at the cave entrance, you will explore this remarkable underground world filled with stalactites, stalagmites, ceremonial chambers, Maya artifacts, and skeletal remains. Lunch is included before returning in the afternoon."
